ChildVault_recoverFailedEpochDeposit
├── when there is no pending recovery
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoPendingRecovery
├── when there is no active adapter
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoActiveAdapter
├── when adapter deposit reverts
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__DepositFailed
└── when recovery succeeds
    ├── it should deposit into the active adapter
    ├── it should store the epoch nonce
    ├── it should clear recovery state
    ├── it should emit DepositToStrategySuccess
    └── it should emit EpochDepositRecoveryCleared
